# The index, config, sync db, and staged media blobs — machine-local, not history.
.hubidubios/
.Radicale.*

# Media-note attachments. Their .md note records ARE versioned (title, kind,
# media_sha256, ...); the heavy binaries are not — they sync device-to-device
# over the blob channel, so git history stays lean.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.webp
*.heic
*.gif
*.m4a
*.mp3
*.wav
*.ogg
*.webm
*.mp4
